# Responsive Design Patterns

## Mobile-First Approach

Start with mobile styles, then add larger breakpoints:

```typescript
// Mobile first
<div className="p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8">
  {/* Padding increases on larger screens */}
</div>
```

## Tailwind Breakpoints

- `sm`: 640px
- `md`: 768px  
- `lg`: 1024px
- `xl`: 1280px
- `2xl`: 1536px

## Common Patterns

### Responsive Grid
```typescript
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
  {items.map(item => <Card key={item.id} />)}
</div>
```

### Responsive Typography
```typescript
<h1 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold">
  Responsive Heading
</h1>
```

### Hide/Show Elements
```typescript
// Hide on mobile
<div className="hidden lg:block">Desktop only</div>

// Show on mobile
<div className="block lg:hidden">Mobile only</div>
```

### Responsive Flex
```typescript
<div className="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-4">
  <div className="lg:w-1/3">Sidebar</div>
  <div className="lg:w-2/3">Content</div>
</div>
```

### Responsive Container
```typescript
<div className="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div className="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    {/* Content */}
  </div>
</div>
```

## Touch Targets

Minimum 44x44px for mobile:
```typescript
<button className="p-3 min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] touch-manipulation">
  <Icon className="w-6 h-6" />
</button>
```

## Responsive Images

```typescript
import Image from 'next/image';

<div className="relative aspect-video w-full">
  <Image
    src="/image.jpg"
    alt="Description"
    fill
    className="object-cover"
    sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw"
  />
</div>
```

## Responsive Forms

```typescript
<form className="space-y-4">
  <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <input className="w-full px-3 py-2" />
    <input className="w-full px-3 py-2" />
  </div>
  <button className="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3">
    Submit
  </button>
</form>
```

## Responsive Navigation

```typescript
// Mobile menu
<nav>
  {/* Desktop menu */}
  <div className="hidden md:flex space-x-4">
    <Link href="/">Home</Link>
    <Link href="/about">About</Link>
  </div>

  {/* Mobile menu button */}
  <button className="md:hidden">
    <MenuIcon />
  </button>
</nav>
```

## Testing Checklist

- [ ] Test at 320px (small mobile)
- [ ] Test at 768px (tablet)
- [ ] Test at 1024px (desktop)
- [ ] Test at 1920px (large desktop)
- [ ] Touch targets ≥44px on mobile
- [ ] Text readable at all sizes
- [ ] No horizontal scroll
- [ ] Images don't overflow
- [ ] Forms usable on mobile

